{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9283dc995c8e17620695715d95b5d9dd790656c606e8cb70c173daf5d48152f0",
      "text": "这个站姿真帅啊！\n我从来没见过比你更帅气的机器人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4afa4298cf6b13e696ddaf5b537fad6ac3d59b9dfc2d8c8911782bfc34afc0ff",
      "text": "不管是表情还是外形，都帅得一塌糊涂。\n让人忍不住看入迷了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd38fbc087860c358a19b2e4e23341d86695da749dd3e4e07da03a84aad7219",
      "text": "……嘿嘿。果然面对中意的手办，\n感情就是容易投入啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb0adf12631410f57e6d76ff2e695d4021480df857ebda310466be02ecc57e9c",
      "text": "话也能顺畅地说出来了，状态不错。\n接下来用这边这个试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1b26ebc4c87944e46039c7521c9e62b1ead67cd7d3272e7628a51d4afc5d959",
      "text": "……等等，都这个时间了？\n差不多该去洗澡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2f3708896d6306a5ab960c4eba099022bc19f6959d9e6fa9c4690e80a571ac",
      "text": "（只要继续对着手办练习，\n当天应该也能帅气地表现好吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000060:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2df22e5eebd558214763a9af8531804f0fa9e864683e3c668125f30b76f8d1df",
      "text": "（嗯。洗完澡嗓子感觉挺舒服的，\n把一开始没说好的那句台词再试一次吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a598581390d47784b0b1568a27e1882b71c6685102c00f0e41f4d0ac6445006",
      "text": "那件衣服挺可爱的，超级适合你哦！\n与其说是衣服，不如说是你很可爱……或者说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d4e2d4bd1372d63b5f461712bd1b35f53dabbf6f9d656815d75be3d8e49762d",
      "text": "（唔……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05f903b050fd019771cad5c55e76c0e98d3f443c9e61562d4107781df1c3ce6a",
      "text": "（果然还是太难为情了……。\n这样子当天真的能赢吗……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000115:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8b8444a2622d5cd1742b5c1ed7f6f555492d97ae1810d642ff1544aa2f2aff",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，突然打电话给你不好意思啊。\n……我有件事想拜托你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c54091f1aff235b3fee6e879db6100a2c456bfe3f70d26a923bbbfee804aa45",
      "text": "想请你去问问Beit的三个人，他们的‘绝招粉丝福利’是什么。\n明天你会见他们对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000127:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afeadfb07d240658ad1846c1daa6293130ea09a056b4ce64cf52b5f2d186b068",
      "text": "是为了《成为万物的万人迷！》\n吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:362d5a87bf5426a13b5498c70cf5a2857d41c2f0c7412162ab65d1b47e7dd3a8",
      "text": "对。啊，顺便说一句，不用去问北斗啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2991f12be560c2d2458ccb581e39a868888d83f43d23c7be99631e0a7355ba34",
      "text": "虽然这种事是那家伙的强项，\n但我也不想输给他啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f47cdfa72ead32c41e43e01baf7610610a2ee393a1957b60c2b7c5243990477f",
      "text": "所以我自己在家里做了各种自主练习……。\n但老实说，没什么底气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40e0c8b9b74f8da46c22fbab5fd9f1e25c3ffce1f6b92acaaec98b0e663b475d",
      "text": "Beit给人一种闪闪发光的王子般的感觉吧？\n所以我就想，能不能得到点建议呢……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000138:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000139:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9308b706e2d456c820fd8d48568e01473b68de36f9235b8dbd0094adff2cc5",
      "text": "我这就联系他们\n确认一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_b:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d58d3e8904bab062d3c1e3f23557b34c8a7243da1154bbfc6c393fb84f5f103b",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n那就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
